OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Fthrough the evening with some clear
OL,7,Fspells, chance of the odd light shower
OL,8,Fin the southeast. Remaining mainly dry
OL,9,Fwith some clear spells overnight. A
OL,10,Fmilder night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FMostly dry through the day
OL,13,Fwith bright spells and just the odd
OL,14,Flight shower possible. Cloud and
OL,15,Foccasionally heavy rain spreading east
OL,16,Fthrough the evening. Windy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
