OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FRain
OL,6,Fclearing Wednesday morning, then
OL,7,Fbright spells and scattered showers.
OL,8,FMostly dry Thursday with bright
OL,9,Fspells. Likely quite wet and windy
OL,10,FFriday morning, becoming more settled
OL,11,Flater.
